{
  "id": "regex-tokens",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Düzenli ifadeyle parçala",
    "en": "Split with a regular expression"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Önce küçük harf: `text.lower()`.",
      "en": "Lowercase first: `text.lower()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`re.findall(r\"\\w+|[^\\w\\s]\", text.lower())` listeyi doğrudan verir.",
      "en": "`re.findall(r\"\\w+|[^\\w\\s]\", text.lower())` gives the list directly."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef tokenize(text):\n    return re.findall(r\"\\w+|[^\\w\\s]\", text.lower())\n\nprint(\"|\".join(tokenize(\"Hello, World! It's 5pm.\")))\nprint(\"|\".join(tokenize(\"Fast   delivery...\")))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef tokenize(text):\n    return re.findall(r\"\\w+|[^\\w\\s]\", text.lower())\n\nprint(\"|\".join(tokenize(\"Hello, World! It's 5pm.\")))\nprint(\"|\".join(tokenize(\"Fast   delivery...\")))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "tokenize",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            "Hi, you!"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "hi",
            ",",
            "you",
            "!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "a-b c"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "a",
            "-",
            "b",
            "c"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": [
            ""
          ],
          "returns": []
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "$5"
          ],
          "returns": [
            "$",
            "5"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "hello|,|world|!|it|'|s|5pm|.\nfast|delivery|.|.|."
    }
  ]
}
